unauthorised.title = You can’t access this service with this account
unauthorised.heading = You can’t access this service with this account

agentCannotRegister.title = You cannot register for CBAM with this account
agentCannotRegister.heading = You cannot register for CBAM with this account
agentCannotRegister.p1 = You signed in with an agent services account.
agentCannotRegister.p2 = Your client must register for CBAM using their own account.
agentCannotRegister.p3 = After they’ve registered, you can manage their CBAM account by:
agentCannotRegister.bullet1 = signing in to agent services (opens in new tab)
agentCannotRegister.bullet2 = requesting authorisation to manage your client's CBAM returns
agentCannotRegister.p4 = Find out more about:
agentCannotRegister.bullet3 = using an agent services account (opens in new tab)
agentCannotRegister.bullet4 = who must register for CBAM (opens in new tab)

cannotRegisterIndividual.title = You cannot register for CBAM with an individual account
cannotRegisterIndividual.heading = You cannot register for CBAM with an individual account
cannotRegisterIndividual.p1 = You’ve signed in with an individual account.
cannotRegisterIndividual.p2 = To register your organisation for CBAM, sign in using your organisation’s account details.
cannotRegisterIndividual.link = Find out who must register for CBAM (opens in new tab)

assistantCannotRegister.title = You must be an administrator to register for CBAM
assistantCannotRegister.heading = You must be an administrator to register for CBAM
assistantCannotRegister.p1 = You’re signed in with an organisation account that does not have administrator access. Only an administrator can register your organisation for CBAM.
assistantCannotRegister.p2 = Ask your organisation’s administrator to register for CBAM or give you administrator access so you can register.

alreadyRegistered.title = Your organisation is already registered for CBAM
alreadyRegistered.heading = Your organisation is already registered for CBAM
alreadyRegistered.p = You can manage your CBAM obligations in your CBAM account.
alreadyRegistered.button = Go to CBAM account

liabilityIntroduction.title = We need to work out the date your liability for CBAM started
liabilityIntroduction.heading = We need to work out the date your liability for CBAM started
liabilityIntroduction.p1 = We’ll ask you a few questions to work out when you became liable to register.
liabilityIntroduction.p2 = Your liability to register for CBAM starts on one of these dates:
liabilityIntroduction.bullet1 = when you first expected to import CBAM goods worth £50,000 or more into the UK in the next 30 days
liabilityIntroduction.bullet2 = when you imported CBAM goods worth £50,000 or more into the UK in the past 12 months, as assessed on the first day of each month
liabilityIntroduction.p3 = If both scenarios apply, your liability to register for CBAM starts on the earlier date.
liabilityIntroduction.linkText = Find out more about when liability to register for CBAM starts (opens in new tab)

doNotRegister.title = You do not need to register for CBAM
doNotRegister.heading = You do not need to register for CBAM
doNotRegister.p1 = You must register for CBAM if your organisation:
doNotRegister.bullet1 = expects to import CBAM goods that are valued at £50,000 or more within the next 30 days
doNotRegister.bullet2 = imported CBAM goods valued at £50,000 or more in the past 12 months, as assessed on the first day of each month
doNotRegister.p2 = If your circumstances change and you meet either of these conditions, you must register for CBAM.
doNotRegister.linkText = Find out when you must register for CBAM (opens in new tab)

forwardLookingThreshold.title = Do you expect to import CBAM goods that are valued at £50,000 or more within the next 30 days?
forwardLookingThreshold.heading = Do you expect to import CBAM goods that are valued at £50,000 or more within the next 30 days?
forwardLookingThreshold.hint = Do not include goods imported before 1 January 2027
forwardLookingThreshold.checkYourAnswersLabel = Do you expect to import CBAM goods that are valued at £50,000 or more within the next 30 days?
forwardLookingThreshold.error.required = Select yes if you expect to import CBAM goods valued at £50,000 or more within the next 30 days
forwardLookingThreshold.change.hidden = whether you expect to import CBAM goods that are valued at £50,000 or more within the next 30 days

expectToExceedThreshold.title = When did you first expect to import CBAM goods with a total value of £50,000 or more?
expectToExceedThreshold.heading = When did you first expect to import CBAM goods with a total value of £50,000 or more?
expectToExceedThreshold.hint = For example, 27 3 2027
expectToExceedThreshold.checkYourAnswersLabel = When did you first expect to import CBAM goods with a total value of £50,000 or more?
expectToExceedThreshold.error.required.all = Enter date you first expected to import CBAM goods with a total value of £50,000 or more
expectToExceedThreshold.error.required.two = Date you first expected to import CBAM goods with a total value of £50,000 or more must include a {0} and {1}
expectToExceedThreshold.error.required = Date you first expected to import CBAM goods with a total value of £50,000 or more must include a {0}
expectToExceedThreshold.error.invalid = Date you first expected to import CBAM goods with a total value of £50,000 or more must be a real date
expectToExceedThreshold.change.hidden = when you first expected to import CBAM goods with a total value of £50,000 or more
expectToExceedThreshold.error.beforeJan27 = Date you first expected to import CBAM goods with a total value of £50,000 or more must be the same as or after 1 January 2027
expectToExceedThreshold.error.notAfterToday = Date you first expected to import CBAM goods with a total value of £50,000 or more must be today or in the past

backwardLookingThreshold.title = Have you imported CBAM goods that are valued at £50,000 or more in the past 12 months?
backwardLookingThreshold.heading = Have you imported CBAM goods that are valued at £50,000 or more in the past 12 months?
backwardLookingThreshold.hint = Do not include goods imported before 1 January 2027
backwardLookingThreshold.checkYourAnswersLabel = Have you imported CBAM goods that are valued at £50,000 or more in the past 12 months?
backwardLookingThreshold.error.required = Select yes if you imported CBAM goods valued at £50,000 or more in the past 12 months
backwardLookingThreshold.change.hidden = whether you imported CBAM goods that are valued at £50,000 or more in the past 12 months

backwardLookingDate.title = When did your imports of CBAM goods reach £50,000 or more within the past 12 months?
backwardLookingDate.heading = When did your imports of CBAM goods reach £50,000 or more within the past 12 months?
backwardLookingDate.hint = For example, 27 3 2027
backwardLookingDate.error.required.all = Enter date your imports of CBAM goods reached £50,000 or more within the past 12 months
backwardLookingDate.error.required.two = Date your imports of CBAM goods reached £50,000 must include a {0} and {1}
backwardLookingDate.error.required = Date your imports of CBAM goods reached £50,000 must include a {0}
backwardLookingDate.error.invalid = Date your imports of CBAM goods reached £50,000 must be a real date
backwardLookingDate.error.beforeJan27 = Date your imports of CBAM goods reached £50,000 must be the same as or after 1 January 2027
backwardLookingDate.error.notAfterToday = Date your imports of CBAM goods reached £50,000 must be today or in the past
backwardLookingDate.checkYourAnswersLabel = When did your imports of CBAM goods reach £50,000 or more within the past 12 months?
backwardLookingDate.change.hidden = when your imports of CBAM goods reached £50,000 or more within the past 12 months

liabilityCheckYourAnswers.title = Confirm liability start date
liabilityCheckYourAnswers.heading = Confirm liability start date

checkOrganisationDetails.title = We need to check your organisation’s details
checkOrganisationDetails.heading = We need to check your organisation’s details
checkOrganisationDetails.p1 = We’ll use the EORI number linked to your account to check the details we have for your organisation.

correctImporterSignIn.title = Sign in to the account for the importer that must register for CBAM
correctImporterSignIn.heading = Sign in to the account for the importer that must register for CBAM
correctImporterSignIn.p1 = If you need to register a different importer, sign out and sign in with the account linked to that importer.
correctImporterSignIn.linkText = Find out more about which importers must register for CBAM (opens in new tab)

noEORINumber.title = We could not find an EORI number linked to this account
noEORINumber.heading = We could not find an EORI number linked to this account
noEORINumber.p1 = If your organisation has an EORI number, you might be signed in to the wrong account.
noEORINumber.a1 = Sign out and sign in with the account linked to the importer you need to register for CBAM
noEORINumber.p2 = If your organisation does not have an EORI number that starts with GB, you must get one before registering for CBAM.
noEORINumber.a2 = Get an EORI number starting with GB
noEORINumber.p3 = It can take up to 5 working days for your EORI number application to be approved.
noEORINumber.p4 = After your EORI number application is approved, return to this service to finish your CBAM registration. Your answers will be saved until {0}.

needToSubscribeCDS.title = You need to subscribe to the Customs Declaration Service before registering for CBAM
needToSubscribeCDS.heading = You need to subscribe to the Customs Declaration Service before registering for CBAM
needToSubscribeCDS.p1 = Subscribing to the Customs Declaration Service will allow you to do things such as:
needToSubscribeCDS.bullet1 = submit import and export declarations using software
needToSubscribeCDS.bullet2 = get your postponed import VAT statements or get your import VAT certificates so you can complete your VAT Return
needToSubscribeCDS.bullet3 = pay Customs Duty and import VAT
needToSubscribeCDS.p2 = It usually takes 2 hours to approve your subscription, but it can take up to 5 working days if we need to make more checks.
needToSubscribeCDS.p3 = After your subscription is approved, return to this service to finish your registration for CBAM. Your answers will be saved until {0}.
needToSubscribeCDS.p4 = If your organisation has already subscribed to the Customs Declaration Service, you might be signed in to the wrong account.
needToSubscribeCDS.signOutLink = Sign out and sign in with the account linked to the importer you need to register for CBAM
needToSubscribeCDS.button = Subscribe to Customs Declaration Service

sectorsToImport.title = Which CBAM sectors do you expect to import goods from?
sectorsToImport.heading = Which CBAM sectors do you expect to import goods from?
sectorsToImport.hint = Sectors you do not select will be recorded as having 0kg of expected imports
sectorsToImport.checkYourAnswersLabel = Which CBAM sectors do you expect to import goods from?
sectorsToImport.error.required = Select which CBAM sectors you expect to import goods from
sectorsToImport.change.hidden = which CBAM sectors you expect to import goods from
